# spell-levels: Lucia's schedule (Healing Water 1, Cure Squall 4, Escape 6 (field only), Tender Rain 8,
# Divine Rain 11, Miracle Tears 13) and no stat buffs at any level. Jian and Lucia (party2_strong), first
# temple battle; Jian Fights, then Lucia's Special list is opened with her level index (0x020B46C0)
# pinned to each level in turn: 1 (Healing Water), 4 (and Cure Squall), 8 (and Tender Rain), 11 (and
# Divine Rain), 13 (and Miracle Tears), 40 (the same five: Quick, Grand Weapon, and Grand Shell are
# gone). Shots ll_lv1 to ll_lv40. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
wait 270
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 0
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv1
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv1
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 3
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv4
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv4
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 7
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv8
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv8
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 10
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv11
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv11
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 12
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv13
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv13
press B 8
wait 60
pin u32 0x020b46c0 39
wait 10
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot ll_lv40
dump 0x020B8844 20 list_ll_lv40
press B 8
wait 60
